     |
bit: .000.0.. ......00 0.....0. .000.00. | ...00.0. .000.00. 0.00.000 0.0.0.0.

                                            byte 0 | nibble H | bit 0 [0] | LE


offset: 0x00000000
hex: 55
len: 1
shift: >> 0 << 7
asm: push rbp
rzil: (seq (set final (- (var rsp) (bv 64 0x8)))
